etti}^{2 \\dim X}(X (\\mathbf{C}), \\Lambda) = \\Lambda \\quad \\text{ for }\n\\Lambda = \\mathbf{Z}, \\ \\mathbf{Z}/n\\mathbf{Z},\n$$", "source_byte_span": {"end": 217, "start": 89}, "source_hash": "sha256:abd982be769e5897d7953543d6fddf40adaedd7a3cf543cc62e3d1dbb96d8590"}], "node_kind": "paragraph", "parent_tag": "03N3", "placeholders": {"MATHSEG_0001": "$$\nH_{Betti}^{2 \\dim X}(X (\\mathbf{C}), \\Lambda) = \\Lambda \\quad \\text{", "MATHSEG_0002": "}\n\\Lambda = \\mathbf{Z}, \\ \\mathbf{Z}/n\\mathbf{Z},\n$$", "MATH_0001": "$X$", "MATH_0002": "$X(\\mathbf{C})$", "MATH_0003": "$X$", "STRUCT_0001": "\\medskip", "STRUCT_0002": "\\noindent"}, "render": {"prefix": "", "suffix": ""}, "risk_level": "R3", "schema_version": 2, "source_commit": "a04446e57ec1fbc252a871afcec7752fb2807b14", "source_math_hash": "sha256:351eae0b2b40c5506b22d8896a41511fddd14848c6246bc563965fe642503ee0", "source_math_skeleton_hash": "sha256:9c2cdf2ef986d7c3f91f5509f3a282705007a09c8116260125f191d547266397", "source_status": "CURRENT", "source_structure_hash": "sha256:92f76756aa558bb82bc54b4187206f8de440cd6b7123383f286e558cc4f6728c", "source_text": "<STRUCT_0001><STRUCT_0002>\nOn the other hand, if <MATH_0001> is a smooth projective complex variety, then\n<MATHSEG_0001> for <MATHSEG_0002>\nwhere <MATH_0002> means the set of complex points of <MATH_0003>. This is a feature\nthat would be nice to replicate in algebraic geometry. In positive\ncharacteristic in particular.", "source_text_hash": "sha256:3489ac0047accfba10db12c7aa0a1d24f58c1822f7315ceb3ec80330e05d9577", "unit_id": "inventory:etale-cohomology:03N3:paragraph/0002"}}}, {"context_id": "locked-English-neighbor:etale-cohomology:inventory:etale-cohomology:03N4:paragraph/0001", "hash": "sha256:ad080c79bbcffdce0c98a1ec0d61b307e44d1752021d77cb01b16b1a3dc3ac1a", "value": {"kind": "locked-English-neighbor", "location": {"byte_end": 4241, "byte_start": 3861, "file": "etale-cohomology.tex", "fragment_hash": "sha256:e3593054792bac879326893a98dcd079a3628